{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1436,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f51624db5c2585b834277b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越过红色悲剧的尽头，\r\n蓝色之星终将闪耀……\r\n我一定会证明给你们看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff884ce6844ee456fc3aaacd890781fb9318946d7878c2ce1fefa7c46b6722ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7aea1fd3b4957ce19e625a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜败已是一目了然。\r\n接下来只需为了故乡，\r\n展现出我的力量即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39684c81c880fbf8a8f5d574f32bcdc07fc7d8cc285aaa23b623fb2f4cd48e50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af230f79f78d336a46ad970a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的强者阻挡在前，\r\n我都会将其击溃。\r\n赌上船桥之名……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6037b01bb329878e77225ef75c14361fc5b94ce97c35de385d346b8908279d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b360f60968dc701b6f9836ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请交给我吧。\r\n我会回到你，还有故乡的大家身边——\r\n比任何人都要快地，回到那里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98192a967aa45d8ebecd313444ac49b580696221b976ab7b157edde9b93c8d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f7aaae8a74d48aaaa09a96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态正佳。\r\n那么……我要去让观众席的气氛，\r\n全都染上船桥的色彩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2bd000fe578604850f2a305bbcdf3ac914d060529fe235d166eefdd78de146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4bb4abe771aee24a39e9de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我们发挥如常，\r\n胜利定能手到擒来……。\r\n伸出的手，一定能触及荣光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d192c7fe7a15b40b011338cc91548d9f678313b5f6b993d4c353cab614ed59b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d15f5dbecf88549c364f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心怀誓言，荣归故里。\r\n——狂怒乐章，出阵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e1898bd05bdf6ee049711952af903865ffa1fa3cbb2b85c686c99d3101602f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:880d5a55a65e9f20ca2c8e88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剩下的唯有展现结果了。\r\n我会全力以赴，展示船桥的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc3071ed2e446db9f992ce4597bf1c9296c7688f76d583edfad06a8494ec12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ead87ffe2b5fbcbc536d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵使深处困境，也要夺取胜利……\r\n这正是展现船桥之魂的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4da1751833ef096d429e03db1d316684694a382e1494657d3c0a5cbec31d100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da996bb94953ef77b377ef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说调整不足是事实，\r\n但唯有战胜逆境，才是真正的强者。\r\n……不必为我担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c59c61272ed3525bc149895f22ae7c4d43230e7ff35de411356b6adf4317bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92f80aef44b42c6e2076f4ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果连这种程度的苦难都无法逾越，\r\n梦想便遥不可及。\r\n……我绝不会认输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d2cbaba60730843ebe9f59f3024f172ed375ae49b02af7f4273ff8fa85d28f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c1cfd1b44ee2c946f6bc38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "父亲、母亲、船桥的大家——\r\n请给我勇气……给我前行的力量……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdfa895f7ce60774e8931ecc12ee4870b0b6df3c1d99d0143e2a2bb7555bb2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623f6c7fd1c67981a1f5c3d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然聚集了这么多猛将……\r\n不，不能胆怯。\r\n我也……一定可以的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f984edb512d88beb1f2ce34af2fe45dcd8ecb99f50b75f49d00f98abd6a176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c11e32dbee8f0c6225ef8c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……。\r\n能请您为我祈祷吗？\r\n……祈祷我的胜利，祈祷故乡的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5598185b9e3ba46d82e4fe1e5a0bce8833275f0eb1a2fcb1e0b042a92e03a890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2104921b5f4298620d48dbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "092cd95e8a64d58d136c3c650b8d9d7cc23ad4ad69c0c649443874ffaa82fc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1f2ff2c3d4d6ac61a9c2cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "486457e67e0b18714bcb7a5eb90056853607e701498cec3056487ea7555162ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ffbb84479aab325c54ced0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2277c2d72e403bcecdeb466b5f6de0ded1847035df490e8e8191d1ca7571eb11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ddc60e970a25c15e5aecd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59526b33ecb9781b065221db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b08a445830f60f831cc69715bfe607a664dd20f0eb7a6b5add5663dfe83b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cae6ad76f36578a3236eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔嗯……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9062a0de186b4f6a95540f6636fa11e8e929f282f4d453be0f38efede1fe0bd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e1a418f8233ed8b2d84877",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c845b0e8358a51138bf0f34f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d69a6e9b47d8ba9190c672a87d66839e1073f6b8d155961afcac0de8c98426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda7b36ee3bcb45a69107fb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们携手努力，果然没有白费功夫呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f427766a95db7ef5fbddaace00be30769bed0cc35e4299fc0b5e5bc340ba901d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3096673e85928181efc6ec3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的鼎力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c77eb52a6424d79af303ff4e545d1c77e0be22bcbe22da9e60d4053ecfbd8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af00477a385961acfe1a8e03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该展现实力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c4368408b94cc9e1764cf3cd49c06dbc03af6847cbb66a35aacacd58017a540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2abac3e728b5734e5429ac92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4e30bf14f0d7ed34e5713d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的鼎力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c77eb52a6424d79af303ff4e545d1c77e0be22bcbe22da9e60d4053ecfbd8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb2ea3bf7b219ef8cc4cc41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态正佳。那么……\n我要去让观众席的空气，\n全都染上船桥的色彩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55004b259ae1debed344b81ec835f875c14765989ee6ca3cacc9119cdfb79a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcce4b54b1e358195f12af38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜败已是一目了然。\r\n接下来只需为了故乡，\r\n展现出我的力量即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39684c81c880fbf8a8f5d574f32bcdc07fc7d8cc285aaa23b623fb2f4cd48e50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3404bddd4e27d0221f250e31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您的鼎力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c77eb52a6424d79af303ff4e545d1c77e0be22bcbe22da9e60d4053ecfbd8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4756fb40f43e5307666821f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2277c2d72e403bcecdeb466b5f6de0ded1847035df490e8e8191d1ca7571eb11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41784b699eac9681712bfac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次，定要为船桥赢回荣誉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d1cc94dfddb44ea0ae4df1d03bd2712084ade5ae8739b496e83fbc1cdab7b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c338761fe66a4953ee9d9df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是中央的高墙吗……下次我一定会跨越它！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c97ddcda8c3985865740c98f7f56b8a4b972cc68d59b72f2a1af39d7eead4cbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8388eb4cd07d3c1893f68837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝不能就这样结束……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3f59fd6365d80c8571828853d91a6a5b4c83fa536147161f46021919c3048f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f105077f25f29152bc187805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份雪辱……我定会洗清……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ad86a2c3b8d7bf27257392a5291ed2e6854a0f5e6f7ca902b300a6c808d1c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f45bd47f8a26086c2e2612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥，最强—————！\r\n……呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ff3dbb1b9cd5c1eec21f1c8f46fbfde27f6e75eac2b7ed32b288e3c57aaa22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6862164f4f3b91b3adf42dfb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要……小看了我们船桥的孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2453923db69310ffda7a1b1808886f7fa1ca692680622179dca26cc862765c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7be72cc9eca67ba09bac030",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出发了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0ce694263efd1691160b9f5e49f60bc34dd1f7f25d745ea81afebfdcc14d9b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45582267def147ecb1dc270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打倒中央……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b45ea87c6605b2086bce904833d69adeb35b9412093253c8af5ba8e99a32c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be382009146915d72cd93163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了履行那天的誓言——\r\n船桥之星，将会比任何人都要闪耀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef617e1fc899645f6ec8df9ad24c6cb9fcd1d9c0b8eda0543fb632e9c774e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32675da862812fce07892c7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是通过歌声，我也会让大家铭记船桥的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d6f5470dcbbfd486a17e25ce57bac8136ff98f483e7b3320211b2cb9b89b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db06f9512b6c9a8100c2a11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了报答那些支持我的人们……\r\n我会竭尽全力去歌唱的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8f20aeed194bb8095137621f21b1afd7d2f6cbf0ed6c70dc3834cf5a10787a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a3e2db34c403ee23275cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油吧，为了故乡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd4fd68bbd9eacfb9a360f35590c99aedd32db92259dedab8547d9f6159750ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e164ec9584402a39e3c5079a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在等着你。\r\n谢谢你没有放弃，朝着故乡——朝着我\r\n伸出了你的手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55744b0f32631c29ee45f4737ff9987009b4c36adb9fa5ba1052dc899de8fb31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be7e46d1d55bc71215c14bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着必须完美。\r\n因为我不想被看轻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e44f312cec4b6931b4130d98d6c4b053cf30c33c84e87dd6b2735b765284218",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2483137b7646dc3a4289428f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然觉得有些太华丽了……\r\n不，必须习惯才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6535a799b54d73e5e55ee2f3ae90491f53cfe19743e598ce15a632bf3bc085a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758965572b3350cba1c54a47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为『船桥之星』，\r\n我会成为照亮未来的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b178f719750a40a15f9437faadf98a259bf5af36883133b41165d4ac51317358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5a48ec55ae89f79d343bbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为船桥的代表，\r\n我会过好无愧于此的学园生活……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4987ef1abfc0c45aaf95b947dfec212a6eb121bbd2fc45d8158669d49443e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339b67b42b5e33b1e1ee4e0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在所有领域，我都要赢过中央。\r\n无论是唱歌，还是跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a886b9e2f82aa916a84ab348f58c9f65fa385447aa28877750e119764d9d010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cd4c1fe456f2365d0ed26b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的天空与大海……真是个不错的意象。\r\n纵使离去，心亦相随。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ca3a332075d8335385107b380f7f7d9392cef1f71c33ff9216a78cdae3f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac40ee0fd3a8208ee085471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d54599ab00476499fd927897da007b95eee1c32ce0950ff8b6774bd786b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c653bf7c08114b8989eac87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装齐整，姿态端正。\r\n无论何时被人看见都没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab12772b9523cd483b6a3f807e6c40696731eab71e9d51c7fa29718520de4160",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08a0363d929433c50c1296f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休息的时候，\r\n要回一趟船桥吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d73710523f9abdcc7c71b6bce11a43d12e85b5b60084e1101797f4ad2eedb3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e7e5b94ad64c0b017071119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了方便活动，\r\n这个长度正好合适呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53302721df9611a4f90645670552130867c5b60f58a546f309dc3a511dead7c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00dba1a252a9dccc6d57e7b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着必须完美。\r\n因为我不想被看轻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e44f312cec4b6931b4130d98d6c4b053cf30c33c84e87dd6b2735b765284218",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e2febd268a667682249638",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然觉得有些太华丽了……\r\n不，必须习惯才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6535a799b54d73e5e55ee2f3ae90491f53cfe19743e598ce15a632bf3bc085a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3a327c0e34008e04781292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为『船桥之星』，\r\n我会成为照亮未来的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b178f719750a40a15f9437faadf98a259bf5af36883133b41165d4ac51317358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b9d4ac26c6f35a553410a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为船桥的代表，\r\n我会过好无愧于此的学园生活……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4987ef1abfc0c45aaf95b947dfec212a6eb121bbd2fc45d8158669d49443e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d5e806f4a098e4ef38b154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在所有领域，我都要赢过中央。\r\n无论是唱歌，还是跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a886b9e2f82aa916a84ab348f58c9f65fa385447aa28877750e119764d9d010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a89a0734d3ea84b756efef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的天空与大海……真是个不错的意象。\r\n纵使离去，心亦相随。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ca3a332075d8335385107b380f7f7d9392cef1f71c33ff9216a78cdae3f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a342abc4730164aee202b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d54599ab00476499fd927897da007b95eee1c32ce0950ff8b6774bd786b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82462f35371228de2b9bf3de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装齐整，姿态端正。\r\n无论何时被人看见都没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab12772b9523cd483b6a3f807e6c40696731eab71e9d51c7fa29718520de4160",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba1605c3e7d75ec685509734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c8cba16649be71cfcafcf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。愿荣光如晨曦般，\r\n遍洒船桥——\r\n今日也请与我一同精进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d191cd45f0e841581466f9307591417a6f03ea48afbaf9e06d20ca2543a2c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d15b322705a908e27f7d836e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服没有褶皱，头发没有睡乱。\r\n……是的。今天也是一位体面的\r\n『船桥』训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2329a22c80b5a04e33a2a16d08393d82a859d660ad23852c6ee7cf86d487bbc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9de309135ab3f7e39934336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是中央，咖啡厅的菜单也很\r\n丰富呢。我的便当……\r\n在营养素方面也不会输哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ae6d3a9cb5ef9655814456a8e41c2500049c920b4cacdec409cb27ee7f9fca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9536dd9188f242e664381b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "武将和破坏神，究竟谁更厉害之类的事\r\n我才不关心。……午休时间\r\n我只想安安静静地度过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8596354390e51128fcfcb9f6bd39feb88407a121b5b2b3e01c54f67704631d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fae3c040d7d387cc8f5ec14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不把疲劳带到明天，早点\r\n休息吧。想要与中央对抗，\r\n必须保持万全的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a9d2291ad343b6130369f5b2196638739c625cad2644ba3e2ed18ae06c5b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:665a39c5a6b842b5702fc35f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上的超市，就是一种战场。\r\n围绕打折熟食的激战——\r\n我会拼尽全力，赢下这一局的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377e145bb4a013292923bcb054c51cce387097d8ff0bf8481f2beaa52c7df39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef86c8359d836634b0a5285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的海边是贝类的宝库。\r\n……周末，要不要再一起去海滩\r\n进行『狩猎』呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c562193d088dce090dd5a210b527d4024b48d9e272d8a40ca6ce8c084024ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb5b3f2d77dbfbfe4f52d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，这股暑气果然还是……\r\n让我稍微有点，\r\n想念海风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16558d2562e66fa0b20f9dfcb9c3994996493d1a7015ef361be66bcccded8229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5800873baf44eb52182d582b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了红腹滨鹬\r\n来到三番濑的季节了呢。\r\n每年的那个啼鸣声，都让我倍感治愈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a103cd6b5326b0b0a54db503341eeb39d23ba43a1e1f7e79800a2ba34b746b6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd63fed974c76b24b66c730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪要是积起来就能滑雪了……\r\n只要别下得太离谱，\r\n我反而很欢迎呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23642ad9b4b2b6663a2402f497b1bb80e35244c4aef4693090130b1dd9b8e1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d1379fe4512893beeb10ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a37197351e029acda65968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又……帮她写作业了。\n虽然很不甘心，但不得不承认\n莫名其妙同学确实是个策士……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1171edacb224b470e36edad294e610f314203ecedfd1c8b9a12a3e8beffdb04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e798d16f3411f8defb44580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子同学是一位不容小觑的人。\n在她那轻飘飘又可爱的外表下，\n能感受到深不可测的强大实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "480443e27fabba8ca6fed7f38028ad2b1ca0adf5674bcf6c76d3fea832dece5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6618ee435d99bf8c8686a819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用船桥的特产，从创升同学那里\n换取情报……这不是什么茶话会，\n而是利益交换。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e099e105a35e978e34075c0de0a1011dbd13ff6a7ee5e095b47cb0a62cdb60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c675554569380f24ead71964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之城同学每隔几天就会\n送我一些『剩下的菜』——\n她难道是在减重吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee4b9d3be6c814c956be635db49d200e0b33b97cb295e19cf69a5a59acf862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565ec5a6c424119d9e76365b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏小姐……在某种意义上，\n是最危险的。那种仿佛老家般的\n安心感……简直难以抗拒……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae0da9e92ff20a795782f576d08f8e464d85a6b96238cebe55508adaadc01f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2a4eb2962a8699372ed1ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是同样的衣装，才更能如实反映出\r\n实力的差距……即使是演唱会，\r\n我也会展现出胜过中央的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9b043ae4e8c528c5b71a6e1b036fe15875e76bcbd804f843a76ee54a3163cf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
